                                "sense_id": "e458a875-bc41-3151-9767-dd0ea769f0e7",
                                "text": "At the same time, every effort will be made to soften prejudice by conciliatory language, winning souls by love and not by bitterness, and remembering the words of St. Francis of Sales, “that more hearts are gained by a spoonful of honey than by tunsful of vinegar.”"
